    {
      "name": "Chat API (WebSocket + REST)",
      "description": "Chat real-time antara ADMIN dan USER menggunakan WebSocket STOMP.\n\n## WebSocket Connection\n- **Endpoint**: ws://localhost:8080/ws (SockJS)\n- **Auth**: Kirim header STOMP `Authorization: Bearer <token>` saat CONNECT\n- **Subscribe**: /topic/chat/{ticketId}\n- **Send**: /app/chat.send\n\n## WebSocket Message Format (Send)\n```json\n{\n  \"ticketId\": 1,\n  \"content\": \"Halo, saya butuh bantuan\"\n}\n```\n\n## WebSocket Message Format (Receive)\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": 1,\n  \"ticketId\": 1,\n  \"ticketNumber\": \"TKT-20260525-001\",\n  \"senderId\": 2,\n  \"senderName\": \"John Doe\",\n  \"senderRole\": \"USER\",\n  \"content\": \"Halo, saya butuh bantuan\",\n  \"sentAt\": \"2026-05-25T10:30:00\"\n}\n```\n\nNote: Postman tidak mendukung STOMP over WebSocket secara langsung. Gunakan REST endpoints di bawah ini untuk mengambil histori chat, dan gunakan tool WebSocket client untuk real-time messaging.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Chat History by Ticket ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/chat/1",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "chat",
                "1"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Mengambil semua pesan chat untuk ticket tertentu berdasarkan ticket ID. Pesan diurutkan berdasarkan waktu kirim (ascending)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Chat History by Ticket Number",
